{#- How to write to the Lab and where to find it, all from the site settings.
    The map is a plain link: the site embeds nothing (CODING_STANDARDS.md). #}
<div class="page wrap text-page">
  <section aria-labelledby="email">
    <h2 id="email">Email</h2>
    <p>Write to the Lab mailbox, <a href="mailto:{{ site.mailbox }}">{{ site.mailbox }}</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="address">
    <h2 id="address">Address</h2>
    <address class="postal-address">{{ site.address }}</address>
    <p><a href="{{ site.map }}">Open the map</a></p>
  </section>
</div>
